y Numerical", "sectionType": "normal", "subject": "607018ee404ae53194e73d91", "questions": [{"_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535a9", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205ae"], "topics": ["60e567ac499d1e49588f95f5"], "concepts": ["60e567ab499d1e49588f95d8"], "question": {"text": "Number of molecules from the following which are exceptions to octet rule is ______\n\\(\\mathrm{CO}_2, \\mathrm{NO}_2, \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4, \\mathrm{BF}_3, \\mathrm{CH}_4, \\mathrm{SiF}_4, \\mathrm{ClO}_2, \\mathrm{PCl}_5, \\mathrm{BeF}_2, \\mathrm{C}_2 \\mathrm{H}_6, \\mathrm{CHCl}_3, \\mathrm{CBr}_4\\)"}, "options": [{"id": "20921b", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535aa"}, {"id": "4dcde4", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535ab"}, {"id": "54453a", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535ac"}, {"id": "6f46d5", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535ad"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535ae", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205ae"], "topics": ["60e2fb2066f9ce3f243b4b76"], "concepts": ["60e2fb1f66f9ce3f243b4b3f"], "question": {"text": "In gaseous triethyl amine the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#34;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#34;</mo></math>&nbsp;bond angle is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi></math>degree."}, "options": [{"id": "987238", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535af"}, {"id": "6a0086", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535b0"}, {"id": "7987f7", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535b1"}, {"id": "b7d527", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535b2"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535b3", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205ae"], "topics": ["60e2fb9e66f9ce3f243b52e8"], "concepts": ["60e56739499d1e49588f8b64"], "question": {"text": "<p>According to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MO</mi></math> theory, number of species/ions from the following having identical bond order is____</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>CN</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math></p>"}, "options": [{"id": "dbc022", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535b4"}, {"id": "7b02d4", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535b5"}, {"id": "b0424b", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535b6"}, {"id": "9978a0", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535b7"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535b8", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205ae"], "topics": ["60e2fb5766f9ce3f243b4f44"], "concepts": ["6162fb836ed13040ec84fc98"], "question": {"text": "<p>The number of following factors which affect the percent covalent character of the ionic bond is______</p><p>A)&nbsp;Polarising power of cation</p><p>B) Extent of distortion of anion</p><p>C) Polarisability of the anion</p><p>D)&nbsp;Polarising power of anion</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "68116a", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535b9"}, {"id": "55442f", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535ba"}, {"id": "b17482", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535bb"}, {"id": "a48749", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535bc"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f382ee0e063d92535bd", "type": "numerical", "cha